{14}{Your dad send me here to find you!}{}{-4}{gf3195 1}{15}{}
{15}{Yes...and you are not the first to come here, friend.  Someone else has already been here, sent by my father as well...}{Yes...and you are not the first to come here, friend.  Someone else has already been here, sent by my father as well...}{}{}{}{}
{16}{I see.  Can you tell me what happened here?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
