{21}{What happened here, Ser'ta?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{22}{Whut happen here?}{}{-4}{}{30}{}
{30}{I don't know, really...one moment everything was completely normal, and then the next we were being attacked by all the machines that I'm sure you encountered on your way in here...}{I don't know, really...one moment everything was completely normal, and then the next we were being attacked by all the machines that I'm sure you encountered on your way in here...}{}{}{}{}
{31}{Do you know why they came here?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{32}{Why the machines come here?}{}{-4}{}{40}{}
{40}{That's what's strange.  Before I came into this chamber, I saw one of the man-machines take the village's magickal talisman from the front entrance.  That is why the village and the surrounding forest have been overrun with evil creatures...the talisman was there to protect us from such beasts...}{That's what's strange.  Before I came into this chamber, I saw one of the man-machines take the village's magickal talisman from the front entrance.  That is why the village and the surrounding forest have been overrun with evil creatures...the talisman was there to protect us from such beasts...}{}{}{}{}
{41}{Hmmm.  Why would the machines want a magickal object?}{}{5}{}{50}{}
{42}{Why machines want majick stuff?}{}{-4}{}{50}{}
{50}{I don't know.  The only other clue I have is this...a red handkerchief.  [He shows you a plain, red handkerchief.]  I don't know what it means, but maybe it will help you shed light on what has happened here...}{I don't know.  The only other clue I have is this...a red handkerchief.  [He shows you a plain, red handkerchief.]  I don't know what it means, but maybe it will help you shed light on what has happened here...}{}{}{}{pf8 1, gf3195 1, pf25 1, pf5 1}
