{88}{I don't know, really...one moment everything was completely normal, and then the next we were being attacked by all manner of strange machines...}{I don't know, really...one moment everything was completely normal, and then the next we were being attacked by all manner of strange machines...}{}{}{}{}
{89}{Do you know why they came here?}{}{5}{}{93}{}
{90}{Why the machines come here?}{}{-4}{}{93}{}
{93}{That's what's strange.  Before I came into this chamber, I saw one of the man-machines take the village's magickal talisman from the front entrance.  That is why the village and the surrounding forest have been overrun with evil creatures...the talisman was there to protect us from such beasts...}{That's what's strange.  Before I came into this chamber, I saw one of the man-machines take the village's magickal talisman from the front entrance.  That is why the village and the surrounding forest have been overrun with evil creatures...the talisman was there to protect us from such beasts...}{}{}{}{}
