{98}{I don't know.  The only other clue I have is this...I found a red handkerchief lying near the village entrance, just before we were attacked.  I don't know what it means, but maybe it will help you shed light on what has happened here...}{}{}{}{}{pf8 1, pf5 1}
{99}{How did you die, Ser'ta?}{}{5}{}{103}{}
