{103}{One came here, as you did.  I thought they came in peace, but they murdered me in cold blood.  I don't know why...}{One came here, as you did.  I thought they came in peace, but they murdered me in cold blood.  I don't know why...}{}{}{}{gf3195 1, pf29 1}
